Z||000002||Will||01-09-2001||10:02 AM||||What <I>kind</I> of Getrag? What car did it come from?<P>I don't know where you can get transmission mount brackets, but <A HREF="http://www.rodneydickman.com" TARGET=_blank>Rodney Dickman</A> has clutch slave brackets, shift linkage, etc.<P>The shift cables are still available new. The clutch master, hydraulic line, pedal and associated brackets can be gotten from any stickshit Fiero parts car.<p>[This message has been edited by Will (edited 01-09-2001).]||||reg||1
